      "content": "That makes sense. We've also had some issues where the loads seem to get \"undone\" or things just seem slightly out of place even when we think we've wrapped them right. It's like there's a bit of unpredictable chaos in the warehouse where small things just go wrong for no reason. Is there anything else we should look for regarding unexpected instability or things causing sudden, odd movements in the stacks?",
